{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;An ordinary report turns into a nightmare with a door opening at the bottom of a cliff.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/4f5b7ad5845f0cf3cc76cda9550342d6.avif?t=1762012193\" width=314 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/140cf662195f126649ce9bd3b795d3fd.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/140cf662195f126649ce9bd3b795d3fd.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/aac79aff3807fd4b3631c1a23caa3616.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/aac79aff3807fd4b3631c1a23caa3616.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/aac79aff3807fd4b3631c1a23caa3616.mp4?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a police officer.<br>On a stormy night, you respond to a routine call \u2014 but a sudden collision, a flipped car, and a fall off a cliff change everything.<br>You survive, but you don\u2019t escape.<br>Before you lies a pitch-black cave, calling to you like the void itself. Inside \u2014 a single door.<br>Beyond the door \u2014 a cursed house.<br>The door shuts behind you, the house breathes, and the demon\u2019s game begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your mission is to identify and document <strong>anomalies</strong> \u2014 distortions in reality \u2014 within the house, and complete the <strong>ritual</strong> that will shatter the demon\u2019s spell.<br>Each correct report brings you closer to freedom; each mistake feeds the demon\u2019s wrath and twists the house further against you.<br>In the end, you will either break the curse \u2014 or remain as a whisper in the memory of the house.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore &amp; Survive:</strong><br>A two-story mansion filled with hidden passages, locked rooms, and places that seem safe\u2026 but never truly are.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Anomaly Hunt:</strong><br>Visual distortions, shadow figures, object displacement, audio interference, time slips, photo/mirror warping\u2026</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Report &amp; Progress:</strong><br>Gather evidence, document the anomaly, and report it correctly to advance the ritual. False reports attract the demon\u2019s attention, raising both risk and tension.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Demon\u2019s Game:</strong><br>The house reacts to your actions \u2014 the more you interfere, the more hostile it becomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Final Journey:</strong><br>Solve all anomalies, complete the sigils of the ritual, and face the demon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/5964f29423b5d182ff99b052b93979b8.avif?t=1762012193\" width=526 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/752005758e7dec55cc3c0fbd269d5990.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/752005758e7dec55cc3c0fbd269d5990.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/c41547f93c052208761b5db84c332b10.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/c41547f93c052208761b5db84c332b10.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/c41547f93c052208761b5db84c332b10.mp4?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Psychological Horror &amp; Atmosphere</strong><br>Even silence has weight: droning hums, shifting footsteps, breaths behind closed doors.<br>Sight, light, and sound form the three pillars of tension.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic Anomaly System</strong><br>Every playthrough randomizes the type, frequency, and location of anomalies \u2014 keeping you off balance and ensuring replayability.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Investigation &amp; Reporting Loop</strong><br>Observe what you see, gather evidence (notes, photo tagging system, audio traces), and report.<br>Correct reports unlock ritual milestones.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ritual &amp; Progression</strong><br>Collect clues from the house\u2019s past (letters, photos, personal items) \u2192 decipher glyphs/symbols \u2192 break seals.<br>The game isn\u2019t about escaping \u2014 it\u2019s about confronting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adaptive Threat System</strong><br>Noise, light exposure, or lingering too long in one area increases the house\u2019s hostility.<br>The longer you play, the more the pressure mounts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Balanced Pacing</strong><br>Quiet dread \u2192 exploration \u2192 first encounter \u2192 escalating pursuit \u2192 final ritual.<br>Each stage builds emotionally and mechanically upon the last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/c6a509fe1246c411964d5c12fa2c5439.avif?t=1762012193\" width=908 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/bf7007a2c25f47712e55236c27948198.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/bf7007a2c25f47712e55236c27948198.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/bf7007a2c25f47712e55236c27948198.mp4?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/9a6b0552b7bba66a1ab279894203031c.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/9a6b0552b7bba66a1ab279894203031c.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/9a6b0552b7bba66a1ab279894203031c.mp4?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Examples of Anomalies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Spatial Distortions:</strong><br>Furniture slightly shifted, doors duplicated, stair rails changing direction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Static Entities:</strong><br>A motionless silhouette in a corner, a figure frozen beneath the stairs, a face staring unblinkingly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Corrupted Objects:</strong><br>An oversized chair stretching to the ceiling, a lamp that elongates unnaturally, a doorknob that shrinks into your palm.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Extra Objects:</strong><br>A second window where there should be one, an extra glass on the table, an additional pair of shoes in the corner.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Distorted Sounds:</strong><br>Half-cut whispers, repeating laughter that fades each time, a melody playing backward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each must be identified, evidenced, and categorized properly to progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story &amp; Theme</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This isn\u2019t just a haunted house \u2014 it\u2019s a place that <strong>remembers</strong>.<br>The mystery behind the call that brought you here intertwines with a personal past buried within the mansion\u2019s walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The question is:<br><strong>\u201cWas it really the demon that called you here\u2026 or the emptiness inside your own past?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The answer lies within your reports.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because this game relies not on jump scares, but on <strong>expectation, silence, and psychological dread</strong>.<br>Because every session offers new anomalies, evoking obsession through investigation.<br>Because the <strong>\u201cFind, Prove, Report, Break\u201d</strong> loop delivers clear goals and a deeply satisfying resolution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game contains <strong>intense tension, dark atmosphere, sudden environmental/audio scares, and supernatural imagery</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973710?t=1762012193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/95de9b5a5cfb982a16eb664a60e85afa2ef1b4d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762012193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/6c59a9e8d2d7856ab749864631bcb5ec85b42630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762012193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/6c59a9e8d2d7856ab749864631bcb5ec85b42630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762012193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;An ordinary report turns into a nightmare with a door opening at the bottom of a cliff.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/4f5b7ad5845f0cf3cc76cda9550342d6.avif?t=1762012193\" width=314 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/140cf662195f126649ce9bd3b795d3fd.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/140cf662195f126649ce9bd3b795d3fd.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/aac79aff3807fd4b3631c1a23caa3616.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka