<strong>Report &amp; Progress:</strong><br>Gather evidence, document the anomaly, and report it correctly to advance the ritual. False reports attract the demon\u2019s attention, raising both risk and tension.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Demon\u2019s Game:</strong><br>The house reacts to your actions \u2014 the more you interfere, the more hostile it becomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Final Journey:</strong><br>Solve all anomalies, complete the sigils of the ritual, and face the demon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/5964f29423b5d182ff99b052b93979b8.avif?t=1762012193\" width=526 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/752005758e7dec55cc3c0fbd269d5990.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/752005758e7dec55cc3c0fbd269d5990.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/c41547f93c052208761b5db84c332b10.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/c41547f93c052208761b5db84c332b10.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc