anically upon the last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/c6a509fe1246c411964d5c12fa2c5439.avif?t=1762012193\" width=908 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/bf7007a2c25f47712e55236c27948198.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/bf7007a2c25f47712e55236c27948198.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/bf7007a2c25f47712e55236c27948198.mp4?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/9a6b0552b7bba66a1ab279894203031c.poster.avif?t=1762012193\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/9a6b0552b7bba66a1ab279894203031c.webm?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/extras/9a6b0552b7bba66a1ab279894203031c.mp4?t=1762012193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Examples of Anomalies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Spatial Distortions:</strong><br>Furniture slightly shifted, doors duplicated, stair rails changing direction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Static Entities:</strong><br>A motionless silhouette in a corner, a figure frozen beneath the stairs, a face staring unblinkingly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Corrupted Objects:</strong><br>An oversized chair stretching to the ceiling, a lamp that elongates unnaturally, a doorknob that shrinks into your palm.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Extra Objects:</strong><br>A second window where there should be one, an extra glass on the table, an additional pair of shoes in the corner.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Distorted Sounds:</strong><br>Half-cut whispers, repeating laughter that fades each time, a melody playing backward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each must be identified, evidenced, and categorized properly to progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story &amp; Theme</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This isn\u2019t just a haunted house \u2014 it\u2019s a place that <strong>remembers</strong>.<br>The mystery behind the call that brought you here intertwines with a personal past buried within the mansion\u2019s walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The question is:<br><strong>\u201cWas it really the demon that called you here\u2026 or the emptiness inside your own past?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The answer lies within your reports.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because this game relies not on jump scares, but on <strong>expectation, silence, and psychological dread</strong>.<br>Because every session offers new anomalies, evoking obsession through investigation.<br>Because the <strong>\u201cFind, Prove, Report, Break\u201d</strong> loop delivers clear goals and a deeply satisfying resolution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game contains <strong>intense tension, dark atmosphere, sudden environmental/audio scares, and supernatural imagery</strong>.</p>","developers":["Dark Matter"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/e70fe0587135f24ce359fe2b8a0adb1c0224b8bf/header.jpg?t=1762012193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973710/255526940/5d4c1520b9506653b0de893d6aa6eaa96a8d093b/1758567260/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758567986","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973710/255526940/5d4c1520b9506653b0de893d6aa6eaa96a8d093b/1758567260/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758567986","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973710/255526940/5d4c1520b9506653b0de893d6aa6eaa96a8d093b/1758567260/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758567986","id":257204223,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204223/movie480.mp4?t=1758567986","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204223/movie_max.mp4?t=1758567986"},"name":"Without Salvation","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a