e1c9dde3f420148b3bb950ce3572eb97c437.600x338.jpg?t=1762012193"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/8c4e17e406f2c71e4c764df4a6ad0ef54c6d23fd/ss_8c4e17e406f2c71e4c764df4a6ad0ef54c6d23fd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762012193","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/8c4e17e406f2c71e4c764df4a6ad0ef54c6d23fd/ss_8c4e17e406f2c71e4c764df4a6ad0ef54c6d23fd.600x338.jpg?t=1762012193"}],"short_description":"An ordinary dispatch journey of a police officer turns into a dark nightmare with a fatal accident. The mysterious cave at the bottom of the cliff drags you into the demon\u2019s games. In the cursed house where you are trapped, your mission is to detect anomalies and survive by reporting reality.","steam_appid":3973710,"support_info":{"email":"darkmatter.00000000@gmail.com","url":"https://darkmatterstudios.site/"},"supported_languages":"Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://darkmatterstudios.site/"}